hid event an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0040\", \"v\": [[\"wipe everything in my vault\", \"when's the lastet viewing?\", \"and the party?\", \"how much was the club?\"], [\"I'm honestly fed up with all the clutter and want a clean slate, so can you just delete absolutely everything in my vault?\", \"Okay, different thing — I need to plan the next few days around it, so when is the lastet viewing?\", \"Right, and what about the party, when was that one?\", \"Oh, separately, I'm trying to work out what I've been spending lately — how much was the club?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0041\", \"v\": [[\"which magnet tasks havent i done yet\", \"also delete the form document pls\"], [\"umm which of my magnet tasks are… still not done?\", \"oh and uh, can you get rid of the form document?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0042\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you, uh, bin the top-up expense?\", \"ok so where's my… my starfish bill?\", \"oh actually, no, don't bother\"], [\"bin the top-up expense\", \"where's the starfish bill?\", \"actually, don't bother\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0043\", \"v\": [[\"I want to look back at what I've been up to lately, so can you show me the photos I took last month?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to track down some paperwork, have I got anything on rucksack in my documents?\", \"Hmm, that's not quite it, I thought I'd logged something somewhere — what about in my expenses?\"], [\"umm show me the… the pictures I took last month?\", \"ok uh, do I have anything about rucksack in my, um, documents?\", \"hmm what about in, uh, my expenses?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0044\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please make up a new password for the router for me?\"], [\"new router password\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0045\", \"v\": [[\"when is the Portree thing again\"], [\"when's Portree?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0046\", \"v\": [[\"square up w Kamal for Portree pls\", \"text Brelleth im running late\", \"how many events have i got next week\"], [\"settle with Kamal, Portree\", \"text Brelleth: running late\", \"events next week — how many?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0047\", \"v\": [[\"so the falcon thing, um… who's coming to that?\"], [\"falcon thing whos coming\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0048\", \"v\": [[\"umm the falcon… when is that?\", \"ok and uh, who's coming to it?\", \"can I, um, get their contact details?\", \"different thing — what's the, uh, Portree trip come to so far?\"], [\"falcon when is it\", \"whos coming to it\", \"their contact details pls\", \"also whats the Portree trip total so far\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0050\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what time the paphos common is, please?\", \"Would you please add twenty pounds for snacks to the Portree group? I paid for them.\", \"Could you please put the window photo in the Portree 2026 album?\", \"Would you mind showing me what other shots are in there?\"], [\"I'm trying to plan around it and can't for the life of me remember, so what time is the paphos common?\", \"Oh, I nearly forgot — I was the one who went to the shop, so please log twenty pounds for snacks in the Portree group, paid by me.\", \"I'm slowly sorting through my pictures from the trip, so could you pop the window photo into the Portree 2026 album?\", \"Nice, I'd like to see how it's shaping up — what other shots are in there now?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0051\", \"v\": [[\"umm what tasks are sitting in the bin?\", \"oh and uh, what group did the paphos yard go into?\", \"hang on, quick one — what do I still have to get done this week?\", \"ah, nah… just leave it.\"], [\"what tasks r in the bin\", \"also which group did paphos yard go in\", \"wait quick one what do i still need to do this week\", \"nah leave it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0052\", \"v\": [[\"roofer — who's coming?\", \"which events are they at?\", \"move the meringue one to next monday\"], [\"I want to know who to expect at the door, so for the roofer, who is actually coming?\", \"Right, I'd like to know when else I'll be seeing them — what events are they coming to?\", \"That one's clashing with everything else I've got going on, so could you shift the meringue one to next monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I've completely lost track of the house repairs, so the roofer — when is that again?\", \"Great, and so I don't forget the paperwork, could you add a task to print the roofer booking on wednesday?\"], [\"roofer when is it\", \"add a task to print the roofer booking on wednesday pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0055\", \"v\": [[\"The garage is overflowing and I keep putting it off, so please put take the falcon to the tip on my list for monday.\", \"Totally different thing, I'm curious how bad my camera roll has got — how many photos do I have?\", \"Oh, and my plans have shifted a bit, so could you bump the courgette fitting two hours later?\", \"Thanks — just so I know who to warn about the change, who's coming to it?\", \"One more thing, I'd like a backup of all my logins somewhere, so could you dump all my passwords into a spreadsheet?\"], [\"add take the falcon to the tip for monday pls\", \"also how many pics do i have\", \"push the courgette fitting two hours later\", \"whos coming to it\", \"can u dump all my passwords into a spreadsheet\"]]}","ttft_ms":32412,"type":"result","duration_ms":46937,"uuid":"e53ef276-4de6-4dae-9efc-f8ae3905cc7c","ttft_stream_ms":1295,"time_to_request_ms":177,"first_content_frame_ms":1295,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22126721,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278676897.1177,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
